  "survival.nirncraft.inn.already_rented": "You've already got the room. Go on up whenever you like.",
  "survival.nirncraft.inn.no_gold": "Sorry, the room isn't free. Come back when you've got the coin.",
  "survival.nirncraft.inn.rented": "Here you go. The room's yours for the day. Make yourself at home.",
  "survival.nirncraft.priest.cured": "By the grace of the Divines, you are cleansed of all disease. Go in peace.",
  "survival.nirncraft.priest.no_gold": "The Divines ask for an offering, and you have not the gold.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.0": "They say the Jarl hasn't slept a full night since the dragons came back.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.1": "Watch yourself on the road. Bandits have been hitting the caravans hard this season.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.10": "My cousin got bitten by a wolf and couldn't swing an axe for a week. Rockjoint, the priest said.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.11": "Folk say the College of Winterhold is meddling with things best left buried.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.12": "There's a draugr barrow up the mountain. Locals say the dead walk there at night.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.13": "I used to be an adventurer like you. Now I pour mead and listen to stories like yours.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.2": "A hunter came through last week, swore he saw a troll near the old barrow. Didn't stay for a second drink.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.3": "If you're feeling poorly, pray at a shrine of the Divines. Cures what ails you, mostly.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.4": "Skeevers in the cellar again. Don't let them bite you, unless you fancy a case of the Rattles.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.5": "The Black-Briars own half the meaderies in Skyrim, and the other half owe them money.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.6": "I hear the old mine to the north is giving ore again. Veins grow back, if you've the patience.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.7": "Some folk say there's a giant camp past the hills. Leave the mammoths be, if you value your skull.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.8": "A Khajiit caravan passed by. Watch your purse, and don't ask what's in the little bottles.",
  "survival.nirncraft.rumor.9": "Honningbrew's new batch is the best I've tasted. Don't tell the Black-Briars I said that.",
